From b9900f5a51e8ba86f76c530a3301fcae7e3a4eae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:49:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sapphire: camera: match the stock sapphire camera module

Stock camera.ko is CLO camera-kernel 39da27a/b30da5d (r1-07400/07900-DIVAR)
plus Xiaomi changes; recovered from the stock module:
- notify_frame_skip (Xiaomi backport of camera-kernel.lnx.4.0 c782e8c):
  CRM __cam_req_mgr_notify_frame_skip, context/node ops, sensor frame-skip
  array and OPCODE_SENSOR_FRAME_SKIP_UPDATE, tracepoint;
- the back GPIO flash LED driver (qcom,leds-back-gpio-flash, sapphire
  flashlight node) and cam_flash flash-type 2 (enf/enm GPIO);
- SENSOR_CUSTOM_GPIO3 (gpio-custom3, used by 6 sapphire sensor nodes);
- OPE/watchdog/event values and the csiphy 2.5 Gsps delta table.
Drop the topaz-only hardware code that breaks sapphire (KTD2691 I2C
torch with a NULL cci_client, wl2866d sequences) and the three CLO
mem_mgr commits stock does not have. Two stock bugs fixed
(led_gpio_flash probe success after free, NULL op-seq name).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
